<title>JAPAN: Toppan Printing - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toppan Printing - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		456.95		vs	  433.57</p>
<p> Operating	   26.25		vs	   24.03</p>
<p> Current	     32.71		vs	   31.23</p>
<p> Net		   16.36		vs	   15.61</p>
<p> EPS		   23.40 yen	  vs	   22.32 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    699 million	  vs	 699 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.00 yen	  vs	    6.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toppan Printing Co Ltd is involved in commercial and publication printing and packaging.</p>
</text>
